    "pcm": "LookupPcmPlaybackConfig iterates 12 native playback configurations until the zero identifier sentinel. The complete 13-record SoundEntry array ends at the independently indexed staff-roll Sprite table. Each record contains identifier, sample count and playback rate, consumed with their existing canonical field widths. All 156 bytes are identical in US, JP and EU; there are no resource payload bytes or fabricated padding objects."
